pplication instructions.<\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_pxmX9J":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"HOW TO APPLY A SEMI-PERMANENT TEMPORARY TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>We recommend you follow our application instructions and pro-tips here.<\/p><p><a href=\"\/pages\/inkfinity-semi-permanent-tattoo-instructions\" title=\"INKFINITY™ Semi-Permanent Tattoo Instructions\">Semi-Permanent Tattoo Application Instructions<\/a><\/p><p>Although simple! Semi-Permanent tattoo instructions differ from traditional temporary tattoo application. <\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_jgqQMW":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"HOW TO REMOVE A SEMI-PERMANENT TEMPORARY TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_heading_tag":"h3","row_content":"<p>Your semi-permanent tattoo will fade over time as your skin naturally exfoliates. <\/p>","page":"","content_embed":"","button_text_size":"t3","button_label_1":"","button_link_1":"\/","button_style_1":"primary","button_style_1_show_arrow":false,"button_style_1_show_gradient_border":false,"button_1_border_gradient":"linear-gradient(136deg, rgba(10, 234, 237, 1) 11%, rgba(250, 13, 253, 1) 84%)"}},"collapsible_row_rBxwt9":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_open":false,"heading":"WHAT COMES WITH MY SEMI-PERMANENT TATTOO?","icon":"","image_width":20,"row_